<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pl">
    <head>
        <meta charset="utf-8"/>
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/>
        <meta name="theme-color" content="#007cf0">
        {% block meta %}{% endblock %}
        <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="/src/main.css"/>
        <link rel="manifest" href="/manifest_pl.json">
        <script defer="defer" src="/src/main.js"></script>
        {% block head %}{% endblock %}

        <script defer="defer" src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-ZYTND6L39E"></script>
    </head>
    <body>
        <svg aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; width: 0; height: 0; overflow: hidden;">
            <defs>
                {% include "vectors/arrow-drop-down.sym" %}
                {% include "vectors/arrow-drop-up.sym" %}
                {% include "vectors/facebook.sym" %}
                {% include "vectors/flag-de.sym" %}
                {% include "vectors/flag-en-gb.sym" %}
                {% include "vectors/flag-pl.sym" %}
                {% include "vectors/instagram.sym" %}
                {% include "vectors/messenger.sym" %}
                {% include "vectors/mobile.sym" %}
                {% include "vectors/youtube.sym" %}
                {% block vectors %}{% endblock %}
            </defs>
        </svg>

        <header>
            <div>
                <h1 class="main-logo" style="line-height: 1;">
                    <a href="/" title="Startseite" style="text-decoration: none; font-family: 'Arial Black', Gadget, sans-serif; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; display: inline-flex; align-items: baseline;">
                        <span style="color: #1a1a1a; font-size: 42px; letter-spacing: 2px;">TRAJDER</span>
                        <sup style="color: #0056b3; font-size: 16px; position: relative; top: -20px; margin-left: 3px; font-weight: 700;">&copy;</sup>
                    </a>
                </h1>

                <h1 class="second-logo" style="margin: 0; line-height: 1;">
                    <a href="/" title="Startseite" style="text-decoration: none; font-family: 'Arial Black', Gadget, sans-serif; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; display: inline-flex; align-items: baseline;">
                        <span style="color: #1a1a1a; font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: 1px;">TRAJDER</span>
                        <sup style="color: #0056b3; font-size: 12px; position: relative; top: -15px; margin-left: 2px;">&copy;</sup>
                    </a>
                </h1>

                {# <h1> 
                    <a href="/" title="Strona główna">
                        <span class="logo-blue">Patryk</span><span class="logo-orange">Trajder</span></a>
                </h1>
                <h1 class="second-logo">
                    <a href="/" title="Strona główna">
                        <span class="logo-blue">Patryk</span><span class="logo-orange">Trajder</span></a>
                </h1>#}
                <div class="menu">
                    <nav>
                        <ul>
                            {# <li {% if tab === "home" %} class="current" {% endif %}>
                                <a href="/" title="Strona główna">Witaj</a>
                            </li> #}
                            {# <li {% if tab === "about" %} class="current" {% endif %}>
                                <a href="/about/" title="Poznajmy się lepiej!">O mnie</a>
                            </li> #}
                            <li {% if tab === "products" %} class="current" {% endif %}>
                                <a href="/products/">Sklep</a>
                            </li>
                            <li {% if tab === "projects" %} class="current" {% endif %}>
                                <a href="/projects/">Poradniki</a>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <a href="#contact">Kontakt</a>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <div class="language-dropdown">
                                    <button class="current" title="Zmień język">
                                        <svg class="icon flag">
                                            <use xlink:href="#icon-flag-pl"></use>
                                        </svg>
                                        <svg class="icon arrow">
                                            <use xlink:href="#icon-arrow-drop-down"></use>
                                        </svg>
                                    </button>
                                    <div class="list">
                                        <button data-lang="en-gb" title="Angielski">
                                            <svg class="icon">
                                                <use xlink:href="#icon-flag-en-gb"></use>
                                            </svg>
                                        </button>
                                        <button data-lang="de" title="Niemiecki">
                                            <svg class="icon">
                                                <use xlink:href="#icon-flag-de"></use>
                                            </svg>
                                        </button>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </nav>
                    <button class="menu-button" aria-label="Menu">
                        <span></span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </header>

        {% block body %}{% endblock %}

        <footer>
            <section id="contact" class="container">
                <div class="social-media">
                    <a href="https://www.youtube.com/patryktrajder" rel="noopener" target="_blank" title="Mój kanał na Youtubie">
                        <svg class="icon youtube">
                            <use xlink:href="#icon-youtube"></use>
                        </svg>
                    </a>
                    <a href="https://facebook.com/patryktrajder" rel="noopener" target="_blank" title="Mój fanpage na Facebooku">
                        <svg class="icon facebook">
                            <use xlink:href="#icon-facebook"></use>
                        </svg>
                    </a>
                    <a href="https://www.instagram.com/patryktrajder" rel="noopener" target="_blank" title="Mój profil na Instagramie">
                        <svg class="icon">
                            <use xlink:href="#icon-instagram"></use>
                        </svg>
                    </a>
                </div>
                <div class="links row">
                    <div>
                        <h3>W sprawie zakupu:</h3>
                        <p>
                            <a href="mailto:sklep@trajder.com" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" title="sklep@trajder.com">sklep@trajder.com</a>
                        </p>
                        <p class="messenger">
                            <svg class="icon">
                                <use xlink:href="#icon-messenger"></use>
                            </svg>
                            <a href="https://www.messenger.com/t/patryktrajder" rel="noopener" target="_blank" title="Napisz do mnie na Messengerze">m.me/patryktrajder</a>
                        </p>
                        <p class="phone">
                            <svg class="icon">
                                <use xlink:href="#icon-mobile"></use>
                            </svg>602 106 170</p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3>Współpraca:</h3>
                        <p>
                            <a href="mailto:patryk@trajder.com" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" title="patryk@trajder.com">patryk@trajder.com</a>
                        </p>
                        <p class="phone">
                            <svg class="icon">
                                <use xlink:href="#icon-mobile"></use>
                            </svg>
                            <a href="tel:+48602106170" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">602 106 170</a>
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3>Regulaminy:</h3>
                        <p>
                            <a href="/privacy-policy.pdf" target="_blank">Polityka prywatności</a>
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            <a href="/terms-of-service.pdf" target="_blank">Regulamin</a>
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
            <div class="copyright">
                <div>
                    <ul class="separated-list">
                        <li>&copy; Patryk Trajder. All rights reserved.</li>
                        <li>
                            Design & development:&#32;
                            <a href="https://jakubjanowski.com/pl/" rel="noopener" target="_blank" title="Potrzebujesz strony internetowej?">Jakub Janowski</a>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </footer>

     







<template id="cookies-notice-template">
  <div id="cookies-backdrop" class="cookies-backdrop-hidden"></div>

  <div id="cookies-notice" class="cookies-hidden">
    <div class="heading">Szanujemy Twoją prywatność</div>
<p>
  Używamy plików cookies w celach statystycznych, reklamowych i funkcjonalnych.
  Możesz zaakceptować ich użycie albo odmówić. Szczegółowe informacje znajdziesz w&nbsp;
  <a href="/privacy-policy.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Polityce prywatności</a>.
</p>
    <div class="cookies-actions">
      <button class="reject secondary" type="button">Nie akceptuję</button>
      <button class="accept primary" type="button">Akceptuję</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</template>


{% include "scripts/product-scroller.njk" %}

    </body>
</html>